[HEADING=1][DD] New Post Icon[/HEADING]

[B][DD] New Post Icon[/B] is a specialized UI enhancement for XenForo designed to improve user navigation by visually highlighting new, unread content within thread lists.

[HEADING=2]Installation[/HEADING]
[HEADING=3]1. Upload[/HEADING]
Upload the contents of the upload folder to your XenForo root directory.

[HEADING=3]2. Installation (CLI & AdminCP)[/HEADING]
Install the add-on via CLI or ACP:
[CODE=bash]php cmd.php xf:addon-install cv6/NewPostIcon[/CODE]

[HEADING=2]Setup & Configuration[/HEADING]
In your Admin Control Panel, navigate to:
[B]Styles -> Style Properties -> [DD] New Post Icon[/B]

You can configure the following:
1. [B]New Post Icon[/B]: Enter the FontAwesome class for your preferred icon (e.g., fa-certificate, fa-star, fa-bolt).
2. [B]New Post Icon Color[/B]: Define the icon's color. Supports CSS color names, hex codes, or XenForo style variables (e.g., @xf-paletteColor3).

